Descendants()) do\n\tprocess(v)\nend\n\nworkspace.DescendantAdded:Connect(process)","features":"Auto delete → deletes normal transparent parts\nPass-through → transparent parts in Model/Folder can be walked through\nIgnore mesh → MeshPart / SpecialMesh not affected\nAuto detect → new parts in workspace are processed automatically","tags":["StyearX"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"683c04b5f85943d072649c85","username":"styear","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/363dca406fe87448670842c7e22a81bafe286b61b1ab95bf1278df3c09593925.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/683c04b5f85943d072649c85-1790679618483.png"},"status":"offline","id":"683c04b5f85943d072649c85","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/363dca406fe87448670842c7e22a81bafe286b61b1ab95bf1278df3c09593925.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/683c04b5f85943d072649c85-1790679618483.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:06:13.770Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69b795e210fe3271a4da5f86","editBy":{"_id":"683c04b5f85943d072649c85","username":"styear","status":"offline","id":"683c04b5f85943d072649c85"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-16T05:32:18.312Z"}],"comments":[]}